    "sections": {
        "description": "NTXPlumbing is a modern and professional WordPress theme designed specifically for plumbing companies, HVAC contractors, and home service businesses. It features a clean layout, responsive design, and all the essential sections needed to showcase services, and contact information. Built for speed and easy customization, NTXPlumbing works seamlessly with the drag and drop page builder, allowing you to create beautiful pages without coding. Whether you're a local plumber, emergency repair specialist, or full-service contractor, NTXPlumbing helps you establish a trustworthy online presence and attract more customers with a conversion-focused design."
